    "detailed_description": "<i>Beyond Hanwell is currently in very early active development, please report any bugs or preferences via Steam's discussion boards. I'll try to keep the teaser updated as I develop the full game. Thanks! - Nathan</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beyond Hanwell: The Royal Hallamshire</h2>Head through the gates of The Royal Hallamshire and discover it's secrets. A hospital far beyond the borough of Hanwell, The Royal Hallamshire is a standalone teaser to the upcoming psychological/survival horror <strong>Beyond Hanwell</strong>.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dual control melee combat system, land each hit and combo with satisfying intensity.<br></li><li>Play your own your own way, non linear open gameplay makes for a unique experience. With multiple ways to complete the location.<br></li><li>Immersive. All player feedback is displayed in game, with no HUD whatsoever to keep you immersed and the tension high.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573320/extras/c4c4ad411c6e3c2f3fe635caf0cb3e6c.poster.avif?t=1721760065\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573320/extras/c4c4ad411c6e3c2f3fe635caf0cb3e6c.webm?t=1721760065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573320/extras/c4c4ad411c6e3c2f3fe635caf0cb3e6c.mp4?t=1721760065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore a dynamic environment. Play through The Royal Hallamshire multiple times and discover new ways to finish the location with their secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573320/extras/faf578b58b3d60560a4dc179b337cb9d.poster.avif?t=1721760065\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573320/extras/faf578b58b3d60560a4dc179b337cb9d.webm?t=1721760065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573320/extras/faf578b58b3d60560a4dc179b337cb9d.mp4?t=1721760065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>We're trying to create an effortless control scheme, navigate the environment naturally with minimal tutorial.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573320/extras/fdc43d35dfe4851ee6ba79052af94dff.poster.avif?t=1721760065\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573320/extras/fdc43d35dfe4851ee6ba79052af94dff.webm?t=1721760065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573320/extras/fdc43d35dfe4851ee6ba79052af94dff.mp4?t=1721760065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The Royal Hallamshire is dense, detailed and atmospheric, explore, search, scavenge and survive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573320/extras/676c206049be1a5b5fc5946108427cf1.poster.avif?t=1721760065\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573320/extras/676c206049be1a5b5fc5946108427cf1.webm?t=1721760065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573320/extras/676c206049be1a5b5fc5946108427cf1.mp4?t=1721760065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Interact with the world in various ways, use the environment to take out enemies or open up new paths to discover.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573320/extras/df2393991fad25b4e5e18aef25bebe3e.poster.avif?t=1721760065\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573320/extras/df2393991fad25b4e5e18aef25bebe3e.webm?t=1721760065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573320/extras/df2393991fad25b4e5e18aef25bebe3e.mp4?t=1721760065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dual combat system and environmental blocks. Open up different paths based on what you have available at the time.",
